      "content": "thanks for those. they're a good start. to make the classifier more robust, i need to expand the variety. can you give me more examples specifically focused on how different ethnic groups might be stereotyped in terms of their roles? like, could you provide 5 examples of microaggressions directed at people of color that imply they belong in certain service or lower-level support roles rather than leadership? i need to make sure the model doesn't miss those subtle cues about hierarchy.",
